=3D"style_chapter__grtAe">08</strong><h1>Google Drive app</h1></header><p>C=
loud storage has become fundamental to how we work with files across device=
s. Services such as Google Drive, Dropbox, Microsoft OneDrive, and Apple iC=
loud have revolutionized file management by seamlessly integrating cloud st=
orage into everyday workflows. In this chapter, we'll explore the design of=
 a Google Drive mobile client.</p>
